        "created_at": "2020-05-10T14:07:08.939Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can’t continue the quest chain to obtain green fire for my warlock. I had started the quest and had done the first part of combining with a healthstone and talking to my demons. The next quest was to go to my capital city and talk to one of the warlock trainers. Before that, i had used a level 120 boost on this character forgettig that doing so removes your current quest objectives. now when i try to reobtain the quest by clicking on the Codex again, it is saying that i had already completed the quest. So if i can’t redo the first quest, how am i suppose to continue or am i out of luck?</p>\n<p>Also i have already made a ticket for this issue and i have tried all the options that i was given from it.</p>",
